==Russian==

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|дава́й}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-давай.ogg}}
* {{rhymes|ru|aj|s=2}}

===Particle===
{{head|ru|particle|head=дава́й|when addressing one, familiar person}}

# [[let's]] {{+obj|ru|imperfective&inf}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Дава́й''' [[чита́ть]]|t='''Let’s''' read}}
# to [[let]], [[come on]], [[c'mon]] {{+obj|ru|perfective&first-person&plural&fut}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Дава́й''' [[я]] [[ты|тебе́]] [[помочь|помогу́]]|t='''Let''' me help you}}
# {{label|ru|colloquial}} [[goodbye]], [[see you]]
#: {{ux|ru|[[ну|Ну]], '''дава́й'''!|t=Goodbye}}

===Usage notes===
The corresponding [[V-form]] or the one used when addressing multiple people is [[давайте]]. The word does not require a comma after it.

